/T (Course details: The course adds practical methods that save time. For reading, it teaches previewing, skimming, scanning and grouping words to read faster. It reminds learners of the Zeigarnik effect, the mental discomfort of leaving a task unfinished, which can be used to start and finish work, and it recommends exercise, enough sleep, planning and small relief habits such as a walk, deep breathing or music to keep stress under control. Good planning is also a professional quality: preparedness and perseverance form part of the five Ps of soft skills.)
